From f69c8ed4c49825cd89305497f82a3bd88ee3dcd0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:35:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Sheep Shearer and Romeo & Juliet quests

Both on the quest framework, with the OSRS progress varps Quest Helper reads:
- Sheep Shearer: varp 179 (sheep), 0 not started, 1 started, 1 + balls of wool
  handed in, 21 complete; Fred, The Thing and the hand-in.
- Romeo & Juliet: varp 144 (rjquest) with the OSRS stages 0-100; Romeo, Juliet,
  Father Lawrence, the Apothecary and the cadava potion.
Adds a QuestTalkFixture for dialogue-driven quest tests and interaction tests
for both quests.
